.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP/6-31G*, optimisation and frequencies, orbitals localised. This calculation shows a carbon-carbon single bond: in the MOs panel, field type Localised MO, one sigma C1-C2 orbital. The optimised C-C distance is 1.531 Angstrom and the totally symmetric C-C stretch is at 1009.19 cm-1 (IR inactive); ethene and ethyne use the same method for comparison.
